  "worked_solution": "The determinant of a triangular matrix is equal to the product of the entries on the main diagonal. Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\pi  & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1.5 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2 & \\pi  & 1\\end{aligned}| & =3\\cdot (-1)\\cdot 2\\cdot 1=-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
